    <detaileddescription>
<para>keeps the buffers of <ref refid="group__GeneralGroup_1ga88978dc2a299b9b88ea0033da1865186" kindref="member">fillContours2DPlan</ref> alive between calls (the sweep-line triangulation&apos;s own cache among them), so a caller preparing plans for many holes one by one avoids re-allocating them on every call; one cache must not be used by several threads at once </para>
    </detaileddescription>
